\item[S2] Jihao Liu, \emph{The equality case of Ehrhart\textquotesingle s volume conjecture}, arXiv:2608.01040v2 (2026), Section 1, Conjecture 1.1. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.01040}.
